    \u2013  dodge\nQ  \u2013  fists / pistol      T  \u2013  talk      V  \u2013 
    inside the car      N  \u2013  radio station      O  \u2013  clothes\nTab  \u2013 
    big map (click = waypoint)      M  \u2013  mission card      Esc  \u2013  free
    the mouse"
